  <item>
    <title>Vol. 94 没有人能独自跑完西部一百｜向付召和她身后的那群人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5e03daa3fec224d5a07cdf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5e03daa3fec224d5a07cdf</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 11:26:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎向付召！黄金搭档继去年的GPT和今年Buffalo Stampede后，再次空中相聚。</span></p><p><span>这一期节目，主要由她来分享自己的赛后两份赛记。</span></p><p><span>澳洲GPT报名方式：</span><a href="https://gorunasia.com/" data-url="https://gorunasia.com/"><span>gorunasia.com</span></a></p><p><span>西部一百的终点冲刺：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPKFB7cMXViBKVZwBiLhI4r8aCK.jpg"><p><span>向付召的crew团队赛后合照：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FivTMq3RdXkV3PuP8anzutmrYsT5.jpg"><p><span>颁奖：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/njf1ETC77jN9flXx35W0gN42NUvY.jpg"><p><span>和两位pacer (Eric和Adam) 合练：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm9j6tq1yd24iN7KQFyR4aNcPpls.jpg"><p><span>赛道补给：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FshN9MHD9H3a7gPFLFUauRkzaKV2.jpg"><p><span>大梅子家的跑友聚会：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nuF2hNliHZe7xu1mGjzbda5lyDsf.jpg"><p><span>山顶日落：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAiK2FDF1KFOwydRD0qxhbTOnTJ.jpg"><p><span>雷尼尔雪山徒步搭子，方方，吉吉，Andy ，晓莉姐：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nnafPGRCohbfctDb1_h7Kcq8MUOK.jpg"><p><span>和方方和晓莉姐：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3zspgfHDghJqnJ9wrt_4rV8xvJ.jpg"><p><span>西雅图Su 跑团分享会：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nsyqQcCh19pj43u_Z5fy7huqRlPB.jpg"><p><span>这是Ted接我去训练的早上，我说他很酷，他腰上也有那个皮带扣，很多很多年了：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/noXMCJEDSL1RTvmoDrazfQL3s8j4.jpg"><p><span>Iris 就是那个认识了超过十年的朋友：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nn6LAM3dDL5pbl4OJW8wffivW2do.jpg"><p><span>在Michael家，那天很冷，在家烤火，还烤了红薯。就像小孩子一样，开心快乐。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-eSgY9x7xYAB-GihnpWAnZ0bWU.png"><p><span>和Ken、Michael、Hauha离别时门前合影：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrFsRUBRnwPaKnRj0GU57FzXKIjw.jpg"><p><span>和方方，方方的狗woolly，吉吉，一起去旅行时在游轮上：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nql-Vto_tq2uBllam2F6mC00j0tm.jpg"><p><span>和Hauha、🐱 Black合影告别：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nvDoO3SmDTD3Va0iyJeOvtYkmYYv.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
